AWS Interview Questions (4+ Years Experience)
Core Services & Architecture
Explain the AWS Shared Responsibility Model. Where does customer responsibility begin and end?
How do you design a highly available, fault-tolerant 3-tier architecture on AWS?
Difference between vertical vs horizontal scaling — when do you use each on AWS?
What is the difference between RTO and RPO? How do AWS services map to each?
Explain AWS Global Infrastructure — Regions, AZs, Edge Locations, Local Zones.

Networking (VPC)
Walk through creating a production-grade VPC from scratch.
Difference between Internet Gateway, NAT Gateway, and NAT Instance.
Explain VPC Peering vs Transit Gateway vs AWS PrivateLink — when to use each.
What is a Security Group vs NACL? How do they differ in stateful/stateless behavior?
How do you connect on-premises to AWS? (VPN vs Direct Connect — pros, cons, use cases)
What is VPC Endpoints? Difference between Interface and Gateway endpoints.
How does Route 53 routing work? Explain: Latency, Failover, Geolocation, Weighted, Multi-value.
What is AWS Global Accelerator and how does it differ from CloudFront?

Compute (EC2, ECS, EKS, Lambda)
Explain EC2 instance types — when would you pick compute-optimized vs memory-optimized?
Difference between On-Demand, Reserved, Spot, and Savings Plans — how do you optimize cost?
How does Auto Scaling work? Explain: Target Tracking, Step Scaling, Scheduled Scaling.
What is the difference between Launch Template and Launch Configuration?
ECS vs EKS vs Fargate — when do you choose each?
What are Lambda cold starts? How do you mitigate them?
Explain Lambda concurrency, reserved concurrency, and provisioned concurrency.
How do you run a Lambda inside a VPC? What are the gotchas?

Storage (S3, EBS, EFS, Glacier)
S3 storage classes and when to use each (Standard, IA, One-Zone IA, Glacier, Intelligent-Tiering).
How does S3 versioning, lifecycle policies, and replication (CRR/SRR) work?
Explain S3 consistency model — strong vs eventual.
How do you secure an S3 bucket? (Bucket policy, ACL, Block Public Access, presigned URLs, SSE)
Difference between EBS (gp2 vs gp3 vs io1/io2), EFS, and S3 — when to use each.
What is EBS Multi-Attach and when is it used?
How do you optimize S3 performance for large-scale uploads/downloads?

Databases (RDS, Aurora, DynamoDB, ElastiCache)
RDS Multi-AZ vs Read Replicas — what problem does each solve?
What makes Aurora different from standard RDS? Explain Aurora Global Database.
How does DynamoDB work internally? Explain partition keys, sort keys, and hot partitions.
Difference between DynamoDB Global Tables and standard replication.
Explain DynamoDB Streams, TTL, and DAX (DynamoDB Accelerator).
When would you use ElastiCache (Redis vs Memcached)?
How do you do database migration to AWS with minimal downtime? (DMS, Schema Conversion Tool)

Identity & Security (IAM, KMS, Secrets Manager)
Explain IAM Roles vs Users vs Groups vs Policies.
What is the principle of least privilege? How do you enforce it at scale?
Difference between resource-based policies and identity-based policies.
What is AWS STS (AssumeRole, AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity, cross-account access)?
How does KMS work? CMK vs AWS-managed keys, envelope encryption.
Difference between Secrets Manager and Parameter Store (SSM).
What is AWS Organizations and how do SCPs (Service Control Policies) work?
Explain AWS Cognito — User Pools vs Identity Pools.

Messaging & Eventing (SQS, SNS, EventBridge, Kinesis)
Difference between SQS, SNS, EventBridge, and Kinesis — use case for each.
SQS Standard vs FIFO queue — tradeoffs?
What is a Dead Letter Queue (DLQ)? How do you use it for debugging?
How does Kinesis Data Streams differ from Kinesis Firehose?
What is fan-out pattern with SNS + SQS?
How do you guarantee exactly-once delivery in AWS messaging?

Serverless & API Gateway
API Gateway REST API vs HTTP API vs WebSocket API.
How do you secure APIs in API Gateway? (IAM, Cognito, Lambda Authorizer, API Key)
Explain API Gateway throttling and usage plans.
What is AWS SAM vs Serverless Framework? When would you pick each?
How do you handle Lambda function versioning and aliases?

Monitoring & Observability (CloudWatch, X-Ray, CloudTrail)
Difference between CloudWatch Metrics, Logs, Alarms, and Dashboards.
What is CloudWatch Logs Insights? Give an example query.
How does AWS X-Ray work? What is a trace, segment, and subsegment?
What does CloudTrail capture vs CloudWatch?
How do you set up centralized logging across multiple accounts?
How do you detect and alert on cost anomalies?

Infrastructure as Code & DevOps
CloudFormation Stacks vs StackSets vs Nested Stacks.
What is CloudFormation Drift Detection?
Difference between CodeCommit, CodeBuild, CodeDeploy, CodePipeline.
Explain CodeDeploy deployment strategies — In-place, Blue/Green, Canary, Linear.
How do you manage secrets in CI/CD pipelines on AWS?

Cost Optimization
How do you analyze and reduce AWS costs? (Cost Explorer, Trusted Advisor, Compute Optimizer)
How do you implement tagging strategies for cost allocation?
What is AWS Budgets and how do you set up alerts?
How do you right-size EC2 instances in production?

Containers & Kubernetes
How does ECS task definition work? Difference between task and service.
EKS managed node groups vs self-managed vs Fargate profiles.
How does AWS Load Balancer Controller work with EKS?
What is ECR lifecycle policy and why does it matter?

Real-World Scenarios
Your EC2 instance is unreachable. Walk through your troubleshooting steps.
An RDS database is hitting max connections. What do you do?
A Lambda is timing out intermittently. How do you debug it?
S3 bucket data was accidentally deleted. How do you recover?
Your application is getting throttled by DynamoDB. How do you fix it?
You need to achieve 99.99% uptime. Design the architecture.
How do you migrate a monolith to microservices on AWS?
How do you handle a multi-region active-active setup?

Well-Architected Framework
Explain the 5 pillars of the AWS Well-Architected Framework.
How do you conduct a Well-Architected Review?
What is AWS Trusted Advisor and what categories does it cover?

Tips for the interview: Be ready to whiteboard a VPC setup, explain a real incident you debugged on AWS, and discuss cost decisions you made. At 4+ years, interviewers expect you to have opinions on architecture tradeoffs, not just textbook answers.
